# The compiled crusorai panel slice ships in git so a plain `git pull` — with
# NO manual compile step — updates the Agent pane (field 2026-09-09: three
# rounds of UI fixes never reached the field because the compile step kept
# silently failing). Everything else under out/ stays local-only.
